            "body": "`tangle` is red only because of `sp-search.el`, which is out of sync with its doc on `main` and not touched here (fix: #253). `sp-faces`, the module this PR changes, is not in the list. `build` and `markers` are green.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
